  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enable: Expertise, workforce and support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities to provide technical expertise and support for deployments to regional partners across the Indo-Pacific. This includes an activity to provide technical expertise in the Pacific based on identified country needs, and targeted workforce support for the PNG Institute of Medical Research, the Pacific Community and World Health Organisation (WHO). This investment will also fund additional support for volunteers through the Health Security Corps.</narrative>
  </description>
